# Read by shellcheck for every script under this directory — currently the
# container helpers in docker/ (load-env.sh and the praxis-task wrapper).
#
# No rules are disabled. V1's copy disables SC2119 for a default-argument
# function in ci/jenkins/scripts/lib.sh; v2 carries no CI scripts (see this
# change's proposal), so that suppression would be an unexplained exception
# guarding nothing. A disable belongs here only with the file and reason that
# earn it.
